1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:01,800
Kuching. Seven a.m.

2
00:00:01,800 --> 00:00:04,050
Everyone's having kolo mee.

3
00:00:03,900 --> 00:00:05,533
OFFICER: Attention! Starting today...

4
00:00:05,533 --> 00:00:06,883
kolo mee is BANNED!

5
00:00:07,400 --> 00:00:09,350
Okay. Real facts first.

6
00:00:09,233 --> 00:00:11,067
Kolo mee: Kuching's springy,

7
00:00:11,067 --> 00:00:12,300
dry-tossed noodles.

8
00:00:12,300 --> 00:00:13,467
Char siu on top...

9
00:00:13,467 --> 00:00:15,950
or chicken, for the halal version.

10
00:00:15,800 --> 00:00:16,933
And Sarawak laksa?

11
00:00:16,933 --> 00:00:18,533
Anthony Bourdain called it

12
00:00:18,533 --> 00:00:20,283
'breakfast of the gods'.

13
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:22,000
[ALTERNATE HISTORY — FICTION]

14
00:00:20,300 --> 00:00:22,050
Now... the made-up part.

15
00:00:22,400 --> 00:00:24,033
Day one. Every stall...

16
00:00:24,033 --> 00:00:24,783
closed.

17
00:00:25,200 --> 00:00:26,600
People try spaghetti.

18
00:00:26,600 --> 00:00:27,783
With char siu.

19
00:00:28,400 --> 00:00:29,817
It's... not the same.

20
00:00:31,400 --> 00:00:33,200
Day three. Kolo mee goes...

21
00:00:33,200 --> 00:00:34,217
underground.

22
00:00:35,000 --> 00:00:36,033
AUNTIE: Psst! You want...

23
00:00:36,033 --> 00:00:37,250
'special laksa'?

24
00:00:38,600 --> 00:00:40,667
'Special laksa.' Very special.

25
00:00:40,667 --> 00:00:41,750
Very... dry.

26
00:00:43,400 --> 00:00:45,033
OFFICER: Auntie. Why is your laksa...

27
00:00:45,033 --> 00:00:45,683
so dry?

28
00:00:47,400 --> 00:00:48,650
AUNTIE: New recipe lah!

29
00:00:51,600 --> 00:00:53,417
OFFICER: ...Okay. Bungkus one for me.

30
00:00:56,400 --> 00:00:58,967
RAJAH: One special laksa, extra char siu.

31
00:00:58,967 --> 00:01:01,317
Please... don't tell anyone.

32
00:01:01,400 --> 00:01:03,767
Even a Rajah from another timeline

33
00:01:03,767 --> 00:01:04,917
can't resist.

34
00:01:06,400 --> 00:01:08,250
So... would a ban really work?

35
00:01:09,600 --> 00:01:11,067
Ban something people love...

36
00:01:11,067 --> 00:01:12,817
and they'll find another way.

37
00:01:16,400 --> 00:01:18,583
Day seven. The ban is lifted!

38
00:01:19,000 --> 00:01:20,633
And everyone celebrates...

39
00:01:20,633 --> 00:01:21,583
with laksa.

40
00:01:22,000 --> 00:01:23,917
AUNTIE: Aiyo! After all that?!

41
00:01:24,800 --> 00:01:26,200
Kolo mee or laksa?

42
00:01:26,200 --> 00:01:27,583
Comment below!
